      ],
      "verdict": "accept-final-metadata-body-binding",
      "latin": "Hostias tibi, Domine, in odorem suavitatis offerimus: et praesta; ut, beati Roberti monitis et exemplis edocti, per semitam mandatorum tuorum dilatato corde curramus. Per Dominum nostrum.\n",
      "latin_sha256": "fefc86d1657183e9f354fa827b7cd272b7767b1e075cb0e7ed2342b0a680f592",
      "english": "We offer you sacrificial offerings, O Lord, as a sweet fragrance; and grant that, instructed by the counsels and examples of blessed Robert, we may run with an enlarged heart along the path of your commandments. Through our Lord.\n",
