      "verdict": "accept-final-metadata-body-binding",
      "latin": "Sumptis, Domine, salutaribus sacramentis: da, quaesumus; ut, meritis et intercessione beatae Virginis Mariae in caelum assumptae, ad resurrectionis gloriam perducamur. Per Dominum.\n",
      "latin_sha256": "23b359b97c9082456b44d660b532b9fe07710b62da1c60ee8d7bbe77a6bfcfaf",
      "english": "Having received the saving sacraments, O Lord, we ask you to grant that, through the merits and intercession of the Blessed Virgin Mary assumed into heaven, we may be led to the glory of the resurrection. Through our Lord.\n",
